{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s8aac1f19d6ab2234","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-npc-p11525-2e97c44fb8bc19889923","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s8aac1f19d6ab2234","text":"째깍! 좋은꿈 마을에 온 것을 환영해!","speaker":"「시계 소년」","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["11412820660716793630","1525603013173364098"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3528042516920741898","8054576472749388139","10243348632095039658"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-15c5f58725aad5e0bb15","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s8aac1f19d6ab2234","text":"친구, 시계 소년이 도와줄게, 째깍!","speaker":"「시계 소년」","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["5465563681284253669","744801753959962430","14217452912576758276"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3528042516920741898","8054576472749388139","10243348632095039658"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-d44113b8c8168930043d","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s8aac1f19d6ab2234","text":"오늘 좀 이상한데?","speaker":"","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["17985465050930027105"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-f2bd47cd533025afafa7","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s8aac1f19d6ab2234","text":"…이상하다고?——째깍? 그걸 알아채다니……","speaker":"「시계 소년」","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["4410676188979181298"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3528042516920741898","8054576472749388139","10243348632095039658"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-6ae365e37a7b20f52aba","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s8aac1f19d6ab2234","text":"시계 소년은 스톤 보스의 계략에 넘어가 유통기한이 지난 소다수를 마셔버렸어, 째깍——","speaker":"「시계 소년」","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["3935528439128104980"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3528042516920741898","8054576472749388139","10243348632095039658"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-9e0b4180deac09801e1f","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s8aac1f19d6ab2234","text":"하지만 걱정하지 마. 시계 소년은 금방 다시 기운을 차릴 거야, 째깍!","speaker":"「시계 소년」","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["17020631439306334360"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3528042516920741898","8054576472749388139","10243348632095039658"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-4a41a58a3ab47f0cbb77","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s8aac1f19d6ab2234","text":"네가 왜 여기에…","speaker":"","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["10322364802537781904"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-ee69797fd47b9209cce6","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s8aac1f19d6ab2234","text":"째깍? 좋은꿈 마을은 시계 소년의 집이야. 그러니 여기 있는 게 당연하지!","speaker":"「시계 소년」","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["14391442789623199824"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3528042516920741898","8054576472749388139","10243348632095039658"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-ca1abdcd563a45ea919c","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s8aac1f19d6ab2234","text":"친구, 아직 이 아름다운 마을에 대해 잘 모르는 모양이네?","speaker":"「시계 소년」","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["16574082653626418418"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3528042516920741898","8054576472749388139","10243348632095039658"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-f0af8f0e5551215d8aec","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s8aac1f19d6ab2234","text":"날 믿어. 계속 돌아다니다 보면 금방 이곳의 매력에 빠져들게 될 거야, 째깍!","speaker":"「시계 소년」","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["8058375904046098208"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3528042516920741898","8054576472749388139","10243348632095039658"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-fa3fdef24655b16c5d6c","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s8aac1f19d6ab2234","text":"도와준다고? 다른 사람은 네가 안 보이잖아…","speaker":"","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["1184213228845153618"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-edc8e2075573795c9db2","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s8aac1f19d6ab2234","text":"…째깍? 아, 안 보여? 이럴 수가… 넌 어떻게 알았어, 친구?","speaker":"「시계 소년」","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["2960901852335567418"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3528042516920741898","8054576472749388139","10243348632095039658"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-3bfdc2f9f4a03820986d","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s8aac1f19d6ab2234","text":"소다수 씨의 「은신 민트 소다수」는 나만 아는 비밀인 줄 알았는데!","speaker":"「시계 소년」","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["17279675463502833884"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3528042516920741898","8054576472749388139","10243348632095039658"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-2c4b0f8f95e70354b2ce","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s8aac1f19d6ab2234","text":"착한 친구, 넌 사악한 스톤 보스에게 시계 소년의 비장의 무기를 알려주지 않을 거야, 그렇지?","speaker":"「시계 소년」","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["3529643730492625537"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3528042516920741898","8054576472749388139","10243348632095039658"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-43e63931d814e0d15d39","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s8aac1f19d6ab2234","text":"만나서 정말 반가웠어, 친구. 째깍!","speaker":"「시계 소년」","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["2820854586898138280"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3528042516920741898","8054576472749388139","10243348632095039658"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-e986d4c0b46bd0600f88","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s8aac1f19d6ab2234","text":"좋은꿈 마을에서 즐거운 시간 보내길 바랄게, 째깍——","speaker":"「시계 소년」","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["15709956144772607290"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3528042516920741898","8054576472749388139","10243348632095039658"],"speakerUnresolved":false}],"wikiReading":{"schema":"hsr-wiki-reading.v1","missions":[{"id":"npc-p11525","title":"「시계 소년」","page":"「钟表小子」","officialMissionIds":[]}],"occurrences":[{"id":"other-npc-p11525-2e97c44fb8bc19889923","rowId":"other-npc-p11525-2e97c44fb8bc19889923","missionId":"npc-p11525","mission":"「시계 소년」","sceneId":"s8aac1f19d6ab2234","scene":"NPC 대사 1","contextId":"wiki-context-b4f322424d40723ec78aa66e","page":"「钟表小子」","revision":64190,"location":[0,0],"conditions":[],"branch":[],"nextIds":["other-npc-p11525-15c5f58725aad5e0bb15"],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-15c5f58725aad5e0bb15","rowId":"other-npc-p11525-15c5f58725aad5e0bb15","missionId":"npc-p11525","mission":"「시계 소년」","sceneId":"s8aac1f19d6ab2234","scene":"NPC 대사 1","contextId":"wiki-context-b4f322424d40723ec78aa66e","page":"「钟表小子」","revision":64190,"location":[0,1],"conditions":[],"branch":[],"nextIds":["other-npc-p11525-d44113b8c8168930043d","other-npc-p11525-4a41a58a3ab47f0cbb77","other-npc-p11525-fa3fdef24655b16c5d6c"],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-d44113b8c8168930043d","rowId":"other-npc-p11525-d44113b8c8168930043d","missionId":"npc-p11525","mission":"「시계 소년」","sceneId":"s8aac1f19d6ab2234","scene":"NPC 대사 1","contextId":"wiki-context-b4f322424d40723ec78aa66e","page":"「钟表小子」","revision":64190,"location":[0,2,"option",0,0],"conditions":[],"branch":["75d2d3e7b878-0"],"nextIds":["other-npc-p11525-f2bd47cd533025afafa7"],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-f2bd47cd533025afafa7","rowId":"other-npc-p11525-f2bd47cd533025afafa7","missionId":"npc-p11525","mission":"「시계 소년」","sceneId":"s8aac1f19d6ab2234","scene":"NPC 대사 1","contextId":"wiki-context-b4f322424d40723ec78aa66e","page":"「钟表小子」","revision":64190